menu "Stelle firmware"

    config STELLE_POWER_POLL_MS
        int "Power keeper poll interval (ms)"
        range 5 1000
        default 50
        help
            How often PowerKeeper re-applies the rail state on GPIO27.
            This also bounds the latency of a 0x50 power-off command.

    config STELLE_RING_BYTES
        int "Log ring buffer size (bytes)"
        range 256 16384
        default 4096
        help
            Size of the line-oriented log ring buffer.

endmenu
